COMPILATION OF: E49D2

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E49D2

   1 a 0000 E49D2:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-49/P3] the mirror: QUALIFIED LEFT, BARE RIGHT (`rec.na =
   4 a 0006      nb').  Same alternatives as E49D1; an acceptance here with
   5 a 0006      refusal there (or vice versa) is an orientation-specific
   6 a 0006      qualification boundary -- exactly the shape of P1's asymmetry
   7 a 0006      and a first-class reading, not noise. */
   8 c 0006   dcl
   9 c 0006     1 rec,
  10 c 0006       2 na char(3),
  11 c 0006       2 nb char(3),
  12 c 0006       2 s2 char(2);
  13 c 0006   dcl k fixed bin(15);
  14 c 0006   if rec.na = nb then k = 1;
  15 c 001D   put list('K=', k);
  16 c 003F   stop;
  17 a 0042 end E49D2;

CODE SIZE = 0042
DATA AREA = 000C
FREE SYMS = 3888
END  COMPILATION
